{"n":114,"ar":"الناس","tr":"An-Nas","en":"Mankind","type":"meccan","verses":[[1,"قُلۡ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلنَّاسِ","Qul aAAoothu birabbi alnnasi","Say: I seek refuge in the Lord of mankind"],[2,"مَلِكِ ٱلنَّاسِ","Maliki alnnasi","The King of mankind"],[3,"إِلَٰهِ ٱلنَّاسِ","Ilahi alnnasi","The god of mankind"],[4,"مِن شَرِّ ٱلۡوَسۡوَاسِ ٱلۡخَنَّاسِ","Min sharri alwaswasi alkhannasi","From the evil of the sneaking whisperer"],[5,"ٱلَّذِي يُوَسۡوِسُ فِي صُدُورِ ٱلنَّاسِ","Allathee yuwaswisu fee sudoori alnnasi","Who whispereth in the hearts of mankind"],[6,"مِنَ ٱلۡجِنَّةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ","Mina aljinnati wa alnnasm","Of the jinn and of mankind"]]}